Milicitos are our way of rating food. They go from 1 to 5 and each one is a little Milimon star: the more milicitos, the more we liked it.

They started half as a joke, at an alfajor tasting. We had to pick the best one and, instead of serious scores, we started handing out little stars. The idea stuck.

It is a joke, but we use it for real: whenever we taste something, be it a dish, a recipe or a product, it will get its milicitos.

## The scale

{% milicitos rating=1 %}
We would not have it again.
{% /milicitos %}

{% milicitos rating=2 %}
It has room for improvement.
{% /milicitos %}

{% milicitos rating=3 %}
Tasty, does the job.
{% /milicitos %}

{% milicitos rating=4 %}
Very good, we recommend it.
{% /milicitos %}

{% milicitos rating=5 %}
A classic: you have to try it.
{% /milicitos %}

Soon you will see milicitos on the recipes and in the upcoming reviews.
